WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:08.550
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:15.060
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.890
It's my day!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.470
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.880
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:42.250
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:49.660
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:55.430
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.570
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:10.080
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:16.220
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:19.290
I just want to walk

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:22.830
Not on tip-toe

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.800
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:35.700
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:42.140
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:44.410
It's my day!

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:10.910
<i>This is what she calls
a "casual party"?</i>

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.280
There's all these people from TV!

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.910
Shizuka's house is really amazing.

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.750
There's the F4.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:35.500
<i>Just my luck...</i>

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:39.800
<i>What'll I do?
How can I face him?</i>

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:41.600
<i>That's it!</i>

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:47.040
I've never seen them all at once.
They're pretty handsome, huh?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.250
Why did you bring
that along, Tsukushi?

00:02:56.350 --> 00:03:00.260
<i>I'm not afraid of Tsukasa...
I'm not afraid of Tsukasa...</i>

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:11.700
"The Woman Who Gave Up Everything"

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:20.110
<i>Maybe I should lay low
before I'm spotted.</i>

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:26.640
Hey, Makino...
Were you invited too?

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:36.020
Nice outfit! You look like a deep fish 
dragged up on shore!

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:40.220
Jerk!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.590
Didn't we meet
at that sweet shop?

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.360
Huh? You remember that?

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.900
Of course!
Never forget a pretty face.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:52.680
That's me.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:53.600
Huh?

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:56.670
What do you say? After the party...

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.810
why don't the two of us...

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.490
Nishikado!

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.110
Quit hitting on my friend!

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.100
Yuki, don't get hooked by him.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:09.130
He'll chew you up
and spit you out!

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:11.700
Yuki! Yuki!

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:19.400
By the way, where's Shizuka?

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:20.930
Shizuka?

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:22.380
She's around...

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:24.000
Right, Tsukasa?

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:32.440
I don't know...

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.780
<i>What are you angry about?</i>

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:40.250
<i>I'm the one who should be angry!</i>

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.720
<i>I can't believe this!</i>

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:48.000
<i>No! Stop it! Let me go, Domyoji!</i>

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.030
<i>Treating me like that
for no reason...</i>

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.570
<i>You have no idea
how scared I was.</i>

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:03.280
<i>Aren't you the least bit sorry?</i>

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:04.970
<i>Hey!</i>

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:08.180
Hey! Hey!

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:10.110
Take a look, Tsukushi!

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:12.780
It's Takuya Muraki and
Etsushi Toyota!

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.720
They're hotter in person than on TV!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.720
I should've brought my camera!

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.790
Yuki! Yuki!

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:27.230
Calm down. Celebrities are everyday 
people to socialites like us.

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.500
Hey, that's Maki Mochida!

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.210
Can I have your autograph?
I'm your biggest fan!

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:40.590
But it is incredible. 
The house, the yard, the guests...

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:42.280
Everything's so grand!

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:46.950
<i>Ordinary folks like us could never dream
of living a life like this.</i>

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:48.920
I get the feeling we...

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.520
...don't really belong here.

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:58.520
Wanna get something to eat?

00:05:59.260 --> 00:05:59.930
Sure!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.270
Whoa! Look at all the food!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.670
I've never seen food
like this before.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.650
Where do we start?

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.700
What's that? It looks weird.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.740
I think it's liver...

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:19.900
Yuck! I hate liver.
It tastes like dog sh...

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.290
No! Don't say the word!

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:25.050
It's <i>foie gras</i>.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:27.190
Excuse me...

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:28.020
Yes, sir!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:30.880
Serve them some of that.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:31.990
Yes, sir!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.140
Try it.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.060
Thank you.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:44.970
Tasty! So this is <i>foie gras</i>?

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.390
Aren't you having any?

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:51.000
Me? I'm not fond of meat.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:51.820
I see.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:54.830
Delicious!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.110
I'm glad.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.650
Shall I bring you anything else?

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.950
That's okay. I'll help myself.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:04.890
All right.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:08.790
<i>Rui Hanazawa's so nice.</i>

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:13.360
<i>When he's like this,
I can hardly breathe.</i>

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:17.530
<i>Maybe it's because
it's Shizuka's birthday.</i>

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:24.310
<i>But I can't even enjoy it
because I feel so unclean!</i>

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.560
<i>So why is it...</i>

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:36.590
<i>that I can't stop looking at him?</i>

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.490
Thanks for the flowers the other day.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:43.730
Sure. That was a good movie.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:48.260
Wow! Tsukushi, he's talking
to Miho Kanda.

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:51.800
Tsukasa!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.300
Long time no see.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:54.340
Hey.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.610
Whoa! They're models, you know.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:02.180
You promised you'd call me!

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.650
I've been busy. I'll call next time.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:07.720
You'd better!

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.190
<i>What was with that little smile?!</i>

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:18.960
Tsukushi?

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.930
Can you really eat all that?

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:25.800
<i>That animal!
Everyone's fooled by his looks.</i>

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.900
<i>Men... phooey!</i>

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.240
Please stop it. Please!

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.250
Come on... You're so cute.
Don't you want to be a star?

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:44.490
Isn't that TV producer awful?

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:48.160
He's always like that
after a few drinks.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:52.610
Kimonos are so sexy!

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.500
Please help me!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.010
What's your problem?

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:22.210
You animal! She said no!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.420
Why don't you leave her alone?

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:27.160
What're you yapping about, skank?

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:30.460
I get it... you want
a little attention, too.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.470
Come here and
I'll give you a squeeze.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:46.480
Like I'd let you, you pig!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.680
You don't deserve to live!

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.860
Makino... that's enough.
You'll kill him!

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:10.130
That was great!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:11.700
Incredible!

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:24.520
Thank you so much.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:27.380
No problem.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:29.410
<i>She's so pretty!</i>

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.520
You're Tsukushi Makino, right?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.410
How did you know?

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:35.290
Makino!

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.230
You're unbelievable!

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:41.900
Hang on a sec!

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:48.570
Honestly. You and Tsukasa.
What makes you guys so violent?

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:50.340
Don't lump us together!

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:54.940
What's with those two?!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.220
Ladies and gentlemen...

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.890
Thank you for coming to
my birthday party tonight.

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:05.520
I hope you're all
enjoying yourselves.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.320
Happy Birthday, Shizuka!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.440
Happy Birthday!

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:12.490
Now that I'm 20, I've made
a few important decisions.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.130
I'd like to announce
one of them tonight.

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.490
<i>Shizuka... you're especially
beautiful tonight.</i>

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:26.500
I, Shizuka Todo, will return
to Paris next month.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.240
As for plans to return here...

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.270
I have none.

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:33.280
Huh?

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:38.920
Shizuka... what are you saying?
You just got home!

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:43.320
Father, Mother. Please forgive
my selfish behavior.

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:47.460
Think of me as married and gone.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.230
But you're my heir.
What'll become of Todo Trading?

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:55.770
I want to become a lawyer
and help the poor.

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:57.970
What?

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.010
My glamorous wardrobe and long hair...

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.680
I don't need them anymore.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:21.060
I'm giving up the Todo name.

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:49.150
<i>Shizuka's returning to France?</i>

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.130
What a scoop! Keep shooting!

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.830
"Heiress Renounces Family Fortune!"
This'll be huge!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.560
What a bombshell, Shizuka!

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:10.210
Yeah.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.340
She's nothing like those other girls.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.280
I got the chills.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.250
<i>Shizuka... wow!</i>

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.060
Rui Hanazawa...

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:43.540
I'm leaving.
Let the other guys know.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.850
<i>Rui Hanazawa...
I wonder what he'll do.</i>

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.860
<i>He may never see her again.</i>

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.740
<i>I feel awful...
I must've eaten too much.</i>

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:23.080
<i>And so much has happened
in just one night...</i>

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:26.820
You've grown into a fine young man
since last I saw you.

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.820
I've known you since
you were yea high.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.590
What a coincidence...
so you're the Domyoji Group heir.

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:37.160
I am.

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:41.800
Could you talk with your father about
his contract with us?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.630
I'm sure he'll listen
to his own son.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:48.270
I don't involve myself in
my father's business.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.470
You can't mean that.

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:54.680
See, your father's thinking
only about his own business.

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.480
That's bad for the
Japanese economy.

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.010
As far as that's concerned...

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:02.120
Let's discuss it once
I inherit the business.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.620
That'll be seven... eight years
from now.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:08.860
Of course, that's if you still have
a business by then.

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.360
Let's get out of here.

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:13.460
Fool.

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:18.630
You found me.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:23.500
What're you doing... 
eavesdropping back there?

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.870
I-I didn't do it on purpose!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:30.910
<i>I'm feeling worse by the minute...</i>

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:42.320
<i>I-I've gotta say something.</i>

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:45.860
What a pain
being a corporate heir.

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:48.330
Acting like a bigshot...
you make me wanna puke!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:53.070
I wasn't acting. I am a bigshot.

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:55.900
<i>Moron!</i>

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.540
With a big company like ours...

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:01.870
people who can't see my dad
try getting to him through me.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.880
Plus, you have your 
pick of all the girls.

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:11.350
"I'll call you next time."
What a playboy!

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:13.380
Stupid!

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:19.360
Those girls are social climbers.

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:22.860
They just want my money.
It's written all over their faces.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:25.830
I don't interest them
half as much as my title.

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:28.700
Do you think I'd give girls like that
the time of day?

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:31.040
Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:39.940
I'm sorry.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:43.780
Me too...

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:46.680
Sorry for yelling.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:55.560
And for the other day, too.
Apologize for that.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:01.010
If you do, I'll just write it off
as being bitten by a dog.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.300
And I'll forget about it.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.870
A dog? Is that what I am?

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:09.090
It's just an expression.
Now hurry up and apologize!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:11.740
No way!
You should apologize to me!

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:13.710
What are you talking about?

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.750
Listen... I'm never apologizing.

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:18.550
It's your fault, anyway.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:20.980
What did I do?

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:26.860
That's why I call you a moron.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.130
<i>Uh-oh... I'm feeling really sick...</i>

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:35.930
Look. You should think
before you act.

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.500
I don't want to be told...

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.240
H-hey... what're you doing?

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:48.510
I just told you to think
before acting.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:01.220
Domyoji... I feel awful.
I'm gonna throw up.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:01.890
What?!

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:04.830
H-hang on a minute!

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:06.630
Hey!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.100
My Ermani suit...

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:27.350
Tsukushi! Wake up!

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:34.790
How did I get home?

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:39.930
Mr. Domyoji brought you home.
How did things turn out like that?

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:43.030
Tsukasa did? Oh...

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:44.800
<i>Eek!</i>

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.200
<i>H-hang on a minute!</i>

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:49.170
<i>Hey!</i>

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:54.140
<i>Oh... what have I done?!</i>

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:56.280
Say, Tsukushi...

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:59.150
Isn't that the girl we met in Atami?

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:03.090
"Bobbed Hair! Shizuka Todo, 20,
Renounces the Name of Todo"

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:05.790
It's already in the papers.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.720
Did you read the article about Shizuka?

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:14.600
She's cut her hair and renounced
her family inheritance.

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:17.800
I can't believe she'd give up
her name like that.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:21.330
What does she have 
to complain about?

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:46.060
<i>I didn't think he'd be here.</i>

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:53.800
<i>I...</i>

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.000
<i>I'm having terrible thoughts.</i>

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:06.280
<i>If Shizuka goes to France,
I could have him all to myself.</i>

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.710
What are you staring at?

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:14.890
Nothing...

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:16.420
Really?

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:25.030
You're in shock about Shizuka, right?

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.170
Is it all right?

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:43.480
It's not for me to say.
It's Shizuka's decision.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:49.950
Once she makes up her mind,
she's set.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.270
She's been like that
since she was little.

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:53.600
She hates losing.

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.290
<i>I don't want to be a hothouse flower.</i>

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:05.130
She didn't want special treatment
because she was a Todo.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.640
<i>You understand, don't you, Rui?</i>

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:15.510
It was just like her
to make this decision.

00:21:27.190 --> 00:21:30.990
<i>I've never seen him look
so gentle before.</i>

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:34.860
<i>It shows how much
he feels for her.</i>

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:38.470
<i>But Shizuka's leaving.</i>

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:44.140
<i>Rui Hanazawa... my heart's desire.</i>

00:21:46.510 --> 00:21:49.340
<i>Is it so terrible...</i>

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:52.010
<i>Wanting him all to myself?</i>

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:11.630
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:19.510
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:29.380
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:37.420
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:45.200
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:53.340
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:53.340
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.340 --> 00:23:01.710
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.340 --> 00:23:01.710
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:11.490
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:19.260
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:27.440
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:27.440
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:35.850
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:35.850
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:50.060
Shizuka's throwing it all away
for a new life in France.

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:53.460
Please stay in Japan...
for Rui's sake!

00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:56.630
Why did you grovel to her?
Who asked you to?

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:59.300
Well, you might never
see her again.

00:23:59.600 --> 00:24:01.470
If you love her,
you should go after her.

00:24:02.610 --> 00:24:05.670
